OL,3,AHome sellers cut asking prices on 3,000
OL,4,Aproperties a day
OL,5,
OL,6,FHome sellers cut asking prices on more
OL,7,Fthan 3,000 properties a day on average
OL,8,Fin Britain during September, according
OL,9,Fto figures from Rightmove shared
OL,10,Fexclusively with the BBC.
OL,12,FThe property website said the total was
OL,13,Fthe highest of any month for 15 years
OL,14,Fand was driven, in part, by a glut of
OL,15,Fhomes on the market and some sellers
OL,16,Fsetting unrealistic expectations.
OL,18,FThe proportion of listed homes that
OL,19,Feventually had a price cut peaked in
OL,20,F2023 and has remained relatively high
OL,21,Fsince.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
