OL,3,AKatya Adler: France's government under
OL,4,Apressure after weekend of widespread
OL,5,Aviolence
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrance's Prime Minister Sebastien
OL,8,FLecornu is holding a crisis cabinet
OL,9,Fmeeting on Monday to assess a weekend
OL,10,Fof violence and looting across the
OL,11,Fcountry, in what were some of the worst
OL,12,Fscenes of public disorder in modern
OL,13,FFrench history.
OL,15,FInterior Minister Laurent Nunez tried
OL,16,Fto hand in his resignation, the Elysee
OL,17,FPalace (French President Macron's HQ)
OL,18,Fannounced on Monday morning. But
OL,19,Finstead, Macron has asked him to
OL,20,Fexamine how to make France's streets
OL,21,Fsafer and to bring the perpetrators of
OL,22,Fthe weekend violence to justice.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
