OL,3,AKatya Adler: France's government under
OL,4,Apressure after weekend of widespread
OL,5,Aviolence
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn estimated 1,500 shops and businesses
OL,8,Fwere looted and destroyed. Riot police
OL,9,Ffired tear gas and turned water cannon
OL,10,Fon crowds. They were seen hitting
OL,11,Fpeople with batons in several places.
OL,12,FFrance's interior ministry said about
OL,13,F1,000 police officers were injured on
OL,14,FSaturday, seven of them seriously.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
